/v/t64.5771-25/473393827_681642351331138_1144107631829234471_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnDekccm8bgQ7kNvwGUfdaw&_nc_oc=AdoMBcwWQvT6XZG8aUsAZPnH4ialHDUXbowT8uXtaXGDnj27eRF0cIqlBWygx25wnho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8bGX2jzoEWYLykzHXJJ2mln3L6u1RLH6zHrRglHILy0A&oe=6A4119E7"}, {"file_name": "SS 3.png", "id": "878896681089692", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618056_878896684423025_7938109788866274252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AzEDSbNis20Q7kNvwGKeyky&_nc_oc=Adp6TbfauLdE7-fg2kAtSP3Vd3tspVJIFDF-A3rrubArB6Sg3iXUP0DfFX6pQlniU50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_mDV4eVzEWx3V-0tT3b_8F_50GDrVDc_xciuT5aA52Xw&oe=6A414357"}, {"file_name": "SS 4.png", "id": "675739215286283", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623321_675739218619616_7558413963940472379_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlOrnozPtvgQ7kNvwEA2PkX&_nc_oc=Adq9mesu9qDwkcxLc7KkGPlvP5MPdrpIo2f9mBUqrm6Ky8wAlV3O-Pxc1iXkoVkuJlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_xheZ3q30Ez3YRImGErL7hrks410MD78QJa8hFqk8yyQ&oe=6A4117D1"}, {"file_name": "SS 5.png", "id": "2554056678276810", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307417_2554056681610143_4076224680162324997_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OrDkp5ErZEYQ7kNvwEAz_1G&_nc_oc=AdpVJyMoEoPjZ88vkTEBACf0bt2PqdA1dzXr-B0mj3XT6rfvty9GjWl1b1CUX6yGYgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_vJiXleKMDLdRiOa-Y48ibPzHLilFtb8CySoryTi_uKA&oe=6A413830"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OVRCOMEreality", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to OVRCOMEreality for Corporates, an immersive VR platform for workplace wellness. Using emotional resolution and brain training, it empowers employees to manage stress and reset emotionally in a private, self-guided space. While not a diagnostic tool, OVRCOMEreality improves team well-being and fosters emotional resilience at scale.\n Why OVRCOMEreality?\n Backed by neuroplasticity, our sessions help employees release emotional stress and build clarity. Unlike one-size-fits-all wellness tools, OVRCOMEreality supports long-term change with science-backed methods and immersive VR.\n Key Features:\n Emotional Reset in Under 60 Minutes: Self-paced sessions help teams manage stress and improve focus fast.\n Science-Based Brain Training: Uses neuroplasticity to form healthier emotional patterns and boost performance.\n Self-Guided, Scalable, Impactful: Employees engage when and where they need it.\n Enterprise Dashboard & Insights: Track usage and outcomes across teams.\n Imagine a workplace where your team can manage emotions in real time, stay clear under pressure and bounce back faster. OVRCOMEreality offers a VR-first wellness strategy that integrates easily into daily workflows. Bring emotional strength to your organization today.", "short_description": "Enhance team wellness with OVRCOMEreality for Corporates, an immersive VR tool for emotional resilience and brain training. Empower employees to manage stress, refocus and regain balance through self-guided sessions in under 60 minutes. Built on science-backed techniques, OVRCOMEreality fosters clarity and healthier emotional responses across teams. With secure deployment and impact tracking, it\u2019s a powerful step toward a more focused and emotionally strong workforce\u2014anytime, anywhere."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sheepdogtherapeutics.com/ovrcomereality-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sheepdog Therapeutics LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sheepdogtherapeutics.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "co